  "scope_note_zh": "本模型只表达四段的顺序、相邻关系与共同在场，**不表达任何尺寸**。正文对这张桌子写明「位置、尺寸、材料、无障碍净宽与桌面高度须依现场测绘与无障碍规范确定，本方案不预设数字」，模型因此一律使用无量纲相对单位；任何按本文件推算的实际尺寸都是误用。顺序不可调换是这张桌子的全部主张，模型把它做成几何事实：四段沿同一轴线相接，**人工窗口在最外端且是唯一落地的一段**——撤除时这一段不撤。",
  "scope_note_en": "This model expresses only the order, adjacency and simultaneous presence of the four segments; it expresses **no dimension**. The proposal states that position, size, material, accessible clear width and worktop height must be determined by site survey and accessibility codes and that no figure is assumed here, so the model uses dimensionless relative units; any real dimension derived from this file is a misuse. That the order cannot be swapped is the whole claim of this table, and the model makes it a geometric fact: the four segments meet along one axis and **the human counter is the outermost and the only segment that reaches the ground** — it is the segment that stays when the rest is removed.",
